{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "document:README.md",
      "type": "document",
      "name": "README.md",
      "filePath": "README.md",
      "summary": "项目总览文档，分 28 个小节介绍大麦高并发票务系统的项目背景、业务结构、技术选型、架构与组件设计、高并发亮点以及本地启动方式，并指向在线体验与配套文档/视频目录。",
      "tags": ["documentation", "项目总览", "entry-point", "技术选型", "高并发"],
      "complexity": "complex",
      "languageNotes": "以 Markdown 图文混排为主，技术选型部分使用表格列举 30 余项中间件与框架。"
    },
    {
      "id": "service:docker-compose.yml",
      "type": "service",
      "name": "docker-compose.yml",
      "filePath": "docker-compose.yml",
      "summary": "大麦项目一键部署编排文件，定义 MySQL、Redis、Nacos、Kafka、Elasticsearch 等中间件与 gateway/user/base-data/customize/program/order/pay/admin 八个业务微服务，统一挂载 damai-net 网络、健康检查依赖与数据卷。",
      "tags": ["orchestration", "deployment", "containerization", "infrastructure", "部署编排"],
      "complexity": "complex",
      "languageNotes": "使用 YAML 锚点（x-app-common、x-app-env）复用通用重启策略、网络、环境变量与 depends_on 健康检查条件，减少 8 个业务服务的重复配置。"
    },
    {
      "id": "config:pom.xml",
      "type": "config",
      "name": "pom.xml",
      "filePath": "pom.xml",
      "summary": "Maven 聚合父 POM，声明 10 个模块，统一管理 Java 17、Spring Boot 3.3.0、Spring Cloud 2023.0.2、Spring Cloud Alibaba 2023.0.1.0 以及 MyBatis-Plus、Redisson、ShardingSphere、Caffeine 等依赖版本与编译/源码打包插件。",
      "tags": ["configuration", "build-system", "maven", "dependency-management", "多模块"],
      "complexity": "moderate",
      "languageNotes": "packaging 为 pom 的聚合工程，通过 dependencyManagement 以 import scope 引入三个 BOM；配合 flatten-maven-plugin 与 ${revision} 属性做版本占位符展开。"
    },
    {
      "id": "service:docker-compose.yml:mysql",
      "type": "service",
      "name": "mysql",
      "filePath": "docker-compose.yml",
      "lineRange": [23, 42],
      "summary": "MySQL 8.0 中间件服务，挂载 damai-mysql-data 卷，并把 sql/cloud 目录映射到初始化脚本目录以首次启动自动建库建表。",
      "tags": ["infrastructure", "database", "mysql", "containerization"],
      "complexity": "simple"
    },
    {
      "id": "service:docker-compose.yml:redis",
      "type": "service",
      "name": "redis",
      "filePath": "docker-compose.yml",
      "lineRange": [44, 58],
      "summary": "Redis 7 Alpine 缓存服务，作为分布式缓存与 Lua 脚本、延迟队列等高级特性的载体，端口 6379 对外暴露。",
      "tags": ["infrastructure", "cache", "redis", "containerization"],
      "complexity": "simple"
    },
    {
      "id": "service:docker-compose.yml:nacos",
      "type": "service",
      "name": "nacos",
      "filePath": "docker-compose.yml",
      "lineRange": [60, 83],
      "summary": "Nacos 2.3.2 standalone 服务注册与配置中心，开启鉴权（token/identity）并限制 JVM 堆内存，暴露 8848 与 9848 端口。",
      "tags": ["infrastructure", "service-discovery", "配置中心", "nacos"],
      "complexity": "simple"
    },
    {
      "id": "service:docker-compose.yml:kafka",
      "type": "service",
      "name": "kafka",
      "filePath": "docker-compose.yml",
      "lineRange": [85, 109],
      "summary": "Bitnami Kafka 3.7 单节点（KRaft 模式，controller+broker 合一）消息队列服务，开放 9092 端口供订单、支付等异步链路使用。",
      "tags": ["infrastructure", "消息队列", "kafka", "containerization"],
      "complexity": "simple"
    },
    {
